+# Course requirements reconciliation
+
+**Date:** 26 October 2026
+**Status:** Evidence-based planning note, not a faculty submission or approval.
+
+The available connected-source search did not locate a submitted CampusPool SRS, SAD or Test Plan. The saved faculty files are templates/model examples, and the Drive SE+DBMS plan is a proposal/backlog document. The drafts in this package therefore use new `CP-*` requirement IDs and `NCP-*` test IDs marked proposed. They must be replaced or reconciled against the real submitted documents if the team finds them.
+
+## Evidence consulted
+
+- Faculty/course messages: Gmail message IDs `1a11041dddadf013`, `1a0571d4d8ca9e6e` and `1a11f5cf547b2f7e8` (saved extracts in the private evidence directory; no raw mail content is copied here).
+- Faculty SRS, SAD and STP template extracts supplied through the connected course material.
+- SE Mini-Project Deliverables Part-2 handout dated 6 October 2026.
+- Drive SE+DBMS plan with ID beginning `1whLK4...`; it is treated as a proposal and planning source, not proof of submission or approval.
+- DBMS Level 3 Project Requirements extract dated 9 October 2026.
+
+## Software Engineering requirements
