+| STP with exact template sections, test items, strategy, environment, metrics and approvals | `docs/TEST_PLAN_DRAFT.md` follows the faculty headings | Replace provisional IDs with submitted test-case IDs; obtain role approvals/signatures. |
+| RTM | `docs/RTM_DRAFT.md` maps proposed IDs to real source test filenames | Validate every row against the submitted SRS/STP and final integrated test output. |
+| Sprint 1 implementation and reviewed PRs | Current official repository has CI and prototype evidence; teammate implementation PRs remain separate acceptance gates | Review and merge only through the official team workflow; this private package does not alter official issues or PRs. |
