+| SQL DDL including CREATE, ALTER, DROP, keys, constraints, indexes and views | Migrations demonstrate many CREATE/ALTER/constraint/index operations; a complete course evidence set and appropriate view are not assembled here | Add isolated SQL demonstrations and schema evidence without resetting existing databases. |
+| DML and advanced queries | Application exercises INSERT/UPDATE/SELECT and transactional operations; full JOIN/GROUP BY/HAVING/ORDER BY/subquery evidence is not packaged | Add meaningful query script and result evidence tied to the final schema. |
+| Four advanced SQL concepts and one NoSQL/vector concept | Transactions, indexes and integrity checks are present; four-course-feature proof plus second-paradigm proof is incomplete | Select, implement and document four SQL features and one second-paradigm feature. Current Sprint 1 package is partial. |
+| Next.js web interface | Current interface is Laravel-served HTML/JavaScript; `prototype/package.json` has Vite configuration but no verified Next.js application | Build the required Next.js interface and API integration in Sprint 2 or obtain explicit instructor guidance. Do not label the current browser UI Next.js. |
+| API integration and environment-managed secrets | Laravel API and environment examples exist; production deployment is not established | Document API contracts and secret handling; test with synthetic configuration only. |
+| Authentication and at least two roles | Synthetic driver/rider sessions and authorization checks exist; production college identity is not verified | Implement/verify the required authentication model and role evidence. |
+| Database-level validation and integrity | MySQL constraints, migrations, transaction tests and cancellation invariants are partially evidenced | Complete fresh-database migration, rollback and concurrency proof on disposable services. |
+| Documentation, screenshots, testing and conclusion | Runbook, drafts and test evidence package exist; actual video/screenshots and final academic documentation are pending | Capture genuine UI evidence and assemble final report after review. |
