+| Final demonstration | Synthetic publication → search → request → accept → cancel path is documented and being strengthened | Demonstrate ERD, schema, SQL/second paradigm, Next.js interface and tests only after those components actually exist. |
+
+## Scope decision
+
+The current package can support a truthful Sprint 1 engineering handoff for a synthetic Laravel/MySQL/browser prototype. It cannot by itself satisfy all DBMS Level 3 requirements, especially the Next.js interface, second NoSQL/vector paradigm, four advanced SQL demonstrations, approved two-member team and originality evidence. Those are explicit follow-up gates, not reasons to relabel the current implementation.
